  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"PO1C9\" id=\"PO1C9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc29682dc\" id=\"uc29682dc\">介绍</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u7b46985f\" id=\"u7b46985f\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u041d947e\" id=\"u041d947e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">Turtlesim 是一个用于学习 ROS 2 的轻量级模拟器。它说明了 ROS 2 在最基本的层面上做了什么，让您了解您将在以后使用真实机器人或机器人模拟做什么。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8ed20ac1\" id=\"u8ed20ac1\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub0ba978f\" id=\"ub0ba978f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">rqt 是 ROS 2 的图形用户界面 (GUI) 工具。在 rqt 中所做的一切都可以在命令行上完成，但 rqt 提供了一种更加用户友好的方式来操作 ROS 2 元素。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"VJ3Bz\" id=\"VJ3Bz\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u675439a2\" id=\"u675439a2\">安装turtlesim</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u3adfa05b\" id=\"u3adfa05b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u94e3992c\" id=\"u94e3992c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">检查是否安装了turtlesim</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20pkg%20executables%20turtlesim%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22id%22%3A%22y0qu6%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9f6c6d6c\" id=\"u9f6c6d6c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc08f1f02\" id=\"uc08f1f02\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">上面的命令应该返回 turtlesim 的可执行文件列表：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22turtlesim%20draw_square%5Cnturtlesim%20mimic%5Cnturtlesim%20turtle_teleop_key%5Cnturtlesim%20turtlesim_node%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22id%22%3A%22UkngK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u47362eaf\" id=\"u47362eaf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud17464b8\" id=\"ud17464b8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">如果没有出现上面的列表,说明没有安装turtlesim,可以使用如下命令安装:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20apt%20update%5Cn%5Cnsudo%20apt%20install%20ros-humble-turtlesim%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22id%22%3A%22a9soU%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"O9tyf\" id=\"O9tyf\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc5b79125\" id=\"uc5b79125\">启动turtlesim</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u6e860f9f\" id=\"u6e860f9f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u17203243\" id=\"u17203243\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">要启动 turtlesim，请在终端中输入以下命令：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20run%20turtlesim%20turtlesim_node%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22id%22%3A%22cQG3I%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u9118223e\" id=\"u9118223e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u96c1c4a1\" id=\"u96c1c4a1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">模拟器窗口应该会出现，中间有一只随机的乌龟。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ueb6c0195\" id=\"ueb6c0195\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1685431490109-467d6c67-d013-4c46-a0a8-3d3553988cf0.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1966d67c-5053-41aa-b92e-bcb52ddce72%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u864c6f2b-3b36-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A266.1333333333333%2C%22height%22%3A281%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22turtlesim.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A7812%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A499%2C%22originHeight%22%3A527%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.875%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22search%22%3A%22TURTLESIM%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22x%22%3A213%2C%22y%22%3A6%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A14%2C%22text%22%3A%22TURTLESIM%22%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%234556fe%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uaa4871dd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"IPjny\" id=\"IPjny\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1cc63052\" id=\"u1cc63052\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">使用turtlesim</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u5fae2e6a\" id=\"u5fae2e6a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08173aba\" id=\"u08173aba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">打开一个新终端并再次源 ROS 2。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf53f451d\" id=\"uf53f451d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u21998775\" id=\"u21998775\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">现在您将运行一个新节点来控制第一个节点中的海龟：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22ros2%20run%20turtlesim%20turtle_teleop_key%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RTLH8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"DtODN\" id=\"DtODN\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6e1b203b\" id=\"u6e1b203b\">安装rqt</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"uab7a08ad\" id=\"uab7a08ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9727086\" id=\"ud9727086\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">打开一个新的终端来安装</span><span data-lake-id=\"u57072186\" id=\"u57072186\" class=\"lake-fontsize-9\" style=\"color: rgb(231, 76, 60)\">rqt</span><span data-lake-id=\"u83d4c9a0\" id=\"u83d4c9a0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252)\">及其插件：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22bash%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22sudo%20apt%20update%5Cn%5Cnsudo%20apt%20install%20'~nros-humble-rqt*'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D